{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Landsword</i></strong> is a top-down mecha shooter with a heavy emphasis on destruction and gameplay that combines elements from classic shoot 'em ups with contemporary action-stealth games\u00a0while retaining an arcade feeling.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Combat</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engagements are fast-paced and action-packed, balancing aggressive shooting with strategic dodging of enemy fire. Enemies all have distinct attack patterns and behaviors, prompting players to consider how to best approach and destroy each threat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695630/extras/City_Sweep.gif?t=1747068203\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Terrain destruction</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Players are free to revel in large-scale collateral damage as they carve a path through each level. Every stage has fully destructible environments, including vehicles, props, and structures that persist throughout a mission. What begins as a dense urban battlefield may become a smoldering ruin by the mission\u2019s end.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695630/extras/City.gif?t=1747068203\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Customization</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip and upgrade your maneuver crawler with a wide variety of different parts and weapons before each mission. Different loadouts compliment different missions and environments,  changing the style of combat and movement.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695630/extras/Hangar.gif?t=1747068203\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3695630?t=1747068203","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3695630?t=1747068203","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695630/8048ac341b52cb889d11088428e81412dcacc6f5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747068203","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695630/8048ac341b52cb889d11088428e81412dcacc6f5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747068203","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Landsword</i></strong> is a top-down mecha shooter with a heavy emphasis on destruction and gameplay that combines elements from classic shoot 'em ups with contemporary action-stealth games\u00a0while retaining an arcade feeling.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Combat</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engagements are fast-paced and action-packed, balancing aggressive shooting with strategic dodging of enemy fire. Enemies all have distinct attack patterns and behaviors, prompting players to consider how to best approach and destroy each threat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695630/extras/City_Sweep.gif?t=1747068203\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Terrain destruction</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Players are free to revel in large-scale collateral damage as 